; The glides at a segment's ends. Per segment three cards in (n, pte, nts), per frame six (a, b, uu, g from the
; chooser, wl, wr from the framer); per frame six out (a, b, uu, gn, go, w) for the filter machines. A frame with
; glides (g) at the segment's start (wl, and a sound before: pte) glides from halfway between pte and a: gn pte, go
; a, weight wl; at its end (wr, and a sound after: nts) from halfway between b and nts. Otherwise gn = go = a and the
; weight is 10, all the frame's own.
;
; Address Contents Label Opcode Operand Comment
  03            seg     INP   i        03-09: a segment (i counts its frames down)
  04                    INP   pte
  05                    INP   nts
  06            frm     CLA   i
  07                    SUB   00
  08                    TAC   seg
  09                    STO   i
  10            ca      INP   a        10-34: a frame: none, or a glide at the start
  11            cb      INP   b
  12            cu      INP   uu
  13            cg      INP   g
  14            fl      INP   wl
  15            fr      INP   wr
  16                    CLA   a
  17                    STO   gn
  18                    STO   go
  19                    CLA   c10
  20                    STO   w
  21                    CLA   g
  22                    SUB   00
  23                    TAC   out
  24                    CLA   wl
  25                    SUB   00
  26                    TAC   rt
  27                    CLA   pte
  28                    SUB   00
  29                    TAC   rt
  30                    CLA   pte
  31                    STO   gn
  32                    CLA   wl
  33                    STO   w
  34                    JMP   out
  35            rt      CLA   wr       35-46: a glide at the end
  36                    SUB   00
  37                    TAC   out
  38                    CLA   nts
  39                    SUB   00
  40                    TAC   out
  41                    CLA   nts
  42                    STO   gn
  43                    CLA   b
  44                    STO   go
  45                    CLA   wr
  46                    STO   w
  47            out     OUT   a        47-53: the cards
  48                    OUT   b
  49                    OUT   uu
  50                    OUT   gn
  51                    OUT   go
  52                    OUT   w
  53                    JMP   frm
  60            i       DATA  0
  61            pte     DATA  0
  62            nts     DATA  0
  63            a       DATA  0
  64            b       DATA  0
  65            uu      DATA  0
  66            g       DATA  0
  67            wl      DATA  0
  68            wr      DATA  0
  69            gn      DATA  0
  70            go      DATA  0
  71            w       DATA  0
  72            c10     DATA  10
